<title>NORWAY: Norway's March PPI fell 0.3 pct mnth/mnth.</title>
<headline>Norway's March PPI fell 0.3 pct mnth/mnth.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> NORWAY PRODUCER PRICES     MAR 1997   FEB 1997  MAR 1996</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	  -0.3	 -0.4	+0.4</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	    +1.0	 +1.7	+2.3</p>
<p> Index (base 1981)	     160.2	160.7     158.6</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
